<title>CANADA: Acklands to start share buy-back.</title>
<headline>Acklands to start share buy-back.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acklands Ltd said on Friday it planned to buy back up to 10 percent of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company said it would start to buy back up to 1,043,000 of its shares starting on September 16 and would continue the buy-back program over a period of 12 months.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it believed its common shares were undervalued and may become available during the buy-back period at prices which would make them an attractive use of company funds.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
